# E7(a) D0 on a lock cell: the door's arithmetic
  work function open (space deficit >= wf_floor): econd = 0: halves the cell's field in 3 steps = 0.060 time units = 5.48e-04/J (the lock exchanges once per 1/J = 110 time units)
  work function closed (no deficit): econd = wf_far = 99: Ee = 2.6725 <= econd: the door does not fire. The lock is exempt without a label.

